==English==
{{wikipedia|sacrilege}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{term|sacer|lang=la}} + {{term|lego|legō|steal something sacred|lang=la}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/sæk.ɹəˈlɪdʒ.əs/}}
